flowchart TB
  MIKE[Mike via VPN or SSH tunnel]
  TG[Telegram API]
  S3[S3-compatible off-site storage]

  subgraph VPS[One private VPS - Docker Compose]
    NET[Internal Docker network]
    SCHED[TypeScript scheduler and worker]
    PG[(PostgreSQL 16)]
    HEALTH[Python Data Health on localhost]
    BACKUP[Restic backup job]
    RAW[(Private raw and manifest volumes)]
    SECRETS[Docker secret files]

    SCHED --> PG
    SCHED --> RAW
    HEALTH -->|read-only role| PG
    BACKUP --> PG
    BACKUP --> RAW
    SECRETS --> SCHED
    SECRETS --> PG
    SECRETS --> BACKUP
    NET --- SCHED
    NET --- PG
    NET --- HEALTH
  end

  MIKE -->|private tunnel only| HEALTH
  SCHED -->|sanitized status only| TG
  BACKUP -->|encrypted repository| S3

  PUBLIC[Public inbound traffic]
  PUBLIC -. blocked .-> PG
  PUBLIC -. blocked .-> HEALTH
